me":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-r0.1","local_name":"sase-r0.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-r0","agent_clan_generation":"20260819115959","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-r0.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-r0[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]tmux Agent — launch an interactive agent CLI in a new tmux window[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pressing `t` in Launch Control, or running `sase tmux-agent`, opens[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]a keyboard-first chooser of every registered agent-CLI provider and[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]drops the chosen one into a fresh, auto-numbered tmux window in the[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]current directory. Both surfaces share one registry-driven catalog,[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]so a newly registered provider plugin appears with no code change [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]here.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]tmux_agent_launcher.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/tmux_agent_launcher.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-r0[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-r0/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]tmux_agent configuration section[/bold #D7AFFF]                              [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]config[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]config: add the `tmux_agent` config block, JSON schema entry, shipped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]defaults, and typed getters.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Interactive-CLI provider descriptor[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]descriptor[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]descriptor: add the `llm_interactive_cli` hook plus vendor metadata, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]implement it on every built-in provider, and expose it through the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]registry payload.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Catalog, launch-spec, and window-name resolution[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]catalog[dim] · [dim][/dim]after config, descriptor[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]catalog: build the `sase.tmux_agent` package core — entry model, catalog[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]builder, deterministic shortcut keys, launch-spec resolution, and window[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]naming — as pure, injectable functions.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]tmux window launch, renumber, and menu rendering[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]launcher[dim] · [dim][/dim]after catalog[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]launcher: add the tmux command primitives that create the agent window, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]register the exit-cleanup waiter, renumber agent windows, and render the[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styled `display-menu`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase tmux-agent command[/bold #D7AFFF]                                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after launcher[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: register and dispatch the `sase tmux-agent` command with its menu, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]direct-launch, list, dry-run, JSON, and internal renumber paths.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Catalog cache for menu latency[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]cache[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cache: add the fingerprinted on-disk catalog cache and `-r/--refresh` so[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the tmux key binding renders in well under a quarter second.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Launch Control `t` and the tmux Agent panel[/bold #D7AFFF]                   [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after launcher[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: bind `t` in Launch Control and add the tmux Agent modal, its [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]styles, footer/help wiring, and behavior tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parity guarantee, visual snapshot, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]polish[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ace, cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]polish: pin command parity with the shell script this feature replaces, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add the PNG snapshot, and write the ACE, CLI, configuration, and plugin [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-r0","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-r0.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-7963f98a739d867dd87ad3bb426e8952","started_at":"2026-08-19T16:07:10.937025+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"7831a11fdab5a5ed18266e509e96054cce55f7977c92b7d7e5bbeba3f5522f66","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r0.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"987b0a0cf9967be09cfe735ca75b31690e12bb125c043184a83e2041a11edce2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-r0.4/meta.json","size_bytes":633},"prompt":{"digest":"678b03c5a93beabc256df01c33f64398ef9f0a